ng-wider text-smoke-400\" href=\"/top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame\"><path d=\"M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z\"></path></svg>Cigars</a><a class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 rounded px-3 py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-smoke-400\" href=\"/search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg>Search</a><a class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 rounded px-3 py-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-smoke-400\" href=\"/lounges\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-store\"><path d=\"m2 7 4.41-4.41A2 2 0 0 1 7.83 2h8.34a2 2 0 0 1 1.42.59L22 7\"></path><path d=\"M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M15 22v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h20\"></path><path d=\"M22 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 16 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 12 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 8 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 4 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7\"></path></svg>Lounges &amp; Shops</a></div></div></header></div><main class=\"overflow-x-hidden pb-32\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pb-20 pt-10\"><div class=\"eyebrow mb-2\">Legal</div><h1 class=\"font-display text-5xl tracking-tightest\">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-smoke-400\">Placeholder terms for the preview build — replace with your reviewed legal copy before launch.</p><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-smoke-200\"><div><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-paper\">1. Eligibility</h2><p class=\"mt-1\">You must be 21 years or older to create an account or use MyHumidor. By registering you confirm you meet the legal age for tobacco products in your jurisdiction.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-paper\">2. Your data</h2><p class=\"mt-1\">To run the app we store and process the data tied to your account — your profile, the cigars in your humidor and wishlist, your ratings, who you follow, and related activity. We use it to power features like your feed, recommendations, and lounge discovery.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-paper\">3. Lounges &amp; credits</h2><p class=\"mt-1\">Verified lounges earn credits from CigarTV viewership and may spend them on marketing placements. Credits hold no cash value and are governed by the Lounge Program terms.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-paper\">4. Content &amp; corrections</h2><p class=\"mt-1\">Catalog and lounge data may contain errors. Corrections you submit help improve the database and may be reviewed before they take effect.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg text-paper\">5. Account &amp; deletion</h2><p class=\"mt-1\">You can request deletion of your account and associated data at any time.</p></div></div><a class=\"btn-ghost mt-10 text-sm\" href=\"/register\">← Back to sign up</a></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--><footer class=\"web-chrome border-t border-ember-400/15 px-6 py-12 text-center\"><a aria-label=\"MyHumidor home\" class=\"inline-block transition hover:opacity-80\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/myhumidor-logo.png\" alt=\"MyHumidor by CigarTV\" class=\"mx-auto h-20 w-auto rounded-lg\"/></a><div class=\"mt-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-smoke-400\">By<!-- --> <a href=\"https://cigartv.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-ember-100 transition hover:text-ember-400\">CigarTV</a></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-6 flex max-w-md flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs text-smoke-300\"><a href=\"mailto:submissions@cigartv.com\" class=\"hover:text-ember-100\">Contact us</a><a class=\"hover:text-ember-100\" href=\"/for-brands\">For Brands</a><a class=\"hover:text-ember-100\" href=\"/help\">Help</a><a class=\"hover:text-ember-100\" href=\"/terms\">Terms</a></div><p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl border-t border-ember-400/10 pt-4 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-smoke-400\"><span class=\"font-medium text-smoke-300\">SURGEON GENERAL WARNING:</span> Cigar smoking can cause cancers of the mouth and throat, even if you do not inhale. Tobacco products are intended for adults 21 and older. MyHumidor does not sell tobacco products.</p><p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-smoke-500\">MyHumidor™ and the MyHumidor logo are trademarks of CigarTV. All other brand names, logos, and product images are the property of their respective owners and are used for identification purposes only; their use does not imply endorsement.</p></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/41xcbq-g07oa-.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[84834,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/34vvgjnwauh5c.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1jxd17ets_574.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/190iidhy07ekb.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/09qvmoqsbsmbb.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/357ugjt3tzkls.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1wji1uq6jy92o.js\\\"],\\\"Nav\\\"]\\n3:I[76187,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/34vvgjnwauh5c.js\\\",\